{
  "@context": {
    "@vocab": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/inklet/finkapp/apps/vocab#"
  },
  "@id": "calendar",
  "@type": "App",
  "position": 2,
  "id": "calendar",
  "family": "office",
  "icon": "📅",
  "name": "Calendar",
  "surface": "window",
  "url": "../../magpie/edot/calendar/calendar.html",
  "desc": "Days and plans",
  "capabilities": [
    "storage"
  ],
  "silent": true,
  "tools": true,
  "notes": [
    "TOOLS (2026-11-07): list_calendars and list_events (read-only) and add_event (writes, so an outside caller needs a grant), through foaf.tools in app-sdk.js.",
    "MIGRATED off the escape hatch (July 2026), and the first Office app to manage it. It used IndexedDB, which an opaque origin refuses; its store now falls back to the brokered key/value when IDB will not open, so it keeps its indexes standalone and loses nothing but them here."
  ]
}
